00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
What are some general things that somebody can do for cancer?

00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:10,000
So if I diagnose with cancer, some general things that you want to look at is

00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:19,000
simply start with cleaning up your diet because it's dietary factors that cause of cancer.

