00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:28,000
But cleaning up your diet is going to be the best thing to help stimulate your immune system.

00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Obviously, you have cancer. If I'm diagnosed with cancer, what I'm doing up to this point is not working to get rid of it.

00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:39,000
