00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:01,000
dairy is a big driver because of the growth factors in dairy.

00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Just doing some simple things to clean up your diet is a good thing to do.

00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:17,000
That's going to help your body be able to, your immune system be able to attack the cancer instead of dealing with inflammatory responses because of maybe poor dietary habits.

